      <h1 class="jr-h1">Frozen Shoulder: Why Won't My Shoulder Move, and What Fixes It?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">A shoulder that will not lift your arm to comb your hair is frightening, and most pages about it either promise a quick fix or sell you a supplement. Frozen shoulder is a scarring of the joint capsule, it runs on its own slow timetable, and almost nothing sold for it has been tested in it.</p>

